#
# Expected Criterion benchmark groups of benches/rt_gate.rs.
# Consumed by `nam_perf_gate coverage|verdict --suite rt_gate --manifest`.
# A trailing '*' matches any executed id with that prefix; a group that did not
# run makes the coverage cross-check fail closed (partial/filtered runs cannot
# certify). `PIPE_Host` drives the production RtSwapHarness real load (WaveNet
# A1/A2, LSTM, CabSim); `PIPE_AbOpt` anchors the per-topology envelopes shared
# with the ab_opt_bench ceremony.
PIPE_Host/*
PIPE_AbOpt/*
